---
export function getStaticPaths() {
  return [
    {
      params: { slug: 'complex-document-summarization' },
      props: {
        title: "Complex Document Summarization Prompt for AI",
        category: "Engineering & Analysis",
        description: "Transform lengthy corporate reports, whitepapers, and dense research documents into structured 5-bullet executive summaries.",
        image: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1451187580459-43490279c0fa?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80",
        promptText: "Act as a senior business analyst. Analyze the provided text below. Extract core insights, identify strategic risks, highlight key quantitative metrics, and construct a concise 5-bullet executive summary with actionable recommendations:",
        instructions: "Paste this prompt into ChatGPT Plus (GPT-4o) or Claude 3.5 Sonnet followed by your document text or attached PDF.",
        articleTitle: "Why Executive Document Summarization Matters in Modern Workflows",
        articleBody: [
          "Processing lengthy legal contracts, corporate quarterly reports, and technical documentation consumes dozens of hours every week for analysts and managers. Standard AI summaries often suffer from surface-level glossing, missing crucial financial metrics or operational risks hidden within fine print.",
          "This engineered prompt forces Large Language Models (LLMs) to adopt the mindset of a seasoned management consultant. By enforcing a structured 5-bullet hierarchy, it ensures that quantitative data points and strategic vulnerability factors are prioritized over generic fluff.",
          "For optimal results, ensure your raw input material contains clear section headings or context markers. If you are summarizing technical specifications, you can easily adapt the prompt by specifying your industry domain (e.g., 'Act as a principal software architect') before running the analysis."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      params: { slug: 'cold-email-sales-sequence' },
      props: {
        title: "High-Converting B2B Cold Email Sequence Prompt",
        category: "Marketing & Sales",
        description: "Generate a personalized 3-step B2B cold outreach email series tailored for SaaS products and high-ticket service offers.",
        image: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1460925895917-afdab827c52f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80",
        promptText: "Act as an elite direct-response copywriter. Write a 3-step personalized B2B cold email sequence targeting C-level executives for a SaaS solution. Keep each message under 110 words, focus on acute pain points, avoid sales clichés, and include a frictionless call-to-action:",
        instructions: "Replace target role and industry details in your AI workspace before generating responses.",
        articleTitle: "Crafting High-Response B2B Sales Outreach with Artificial Intelligence",
        articleBody: [
          "Cold email response rates have dramatically declined due to automated spam filters and generic AI template blasts. Decision-makers receive dozens of pitch decks weekly, making brevity and acute personalization the most valuable currency in modern business development.",
          "This outreach prompt is designed around proven direct-response frameworks. Instead of pitching product features upfront, it prompts the AI model to articulate a single core problem and present a low-friction question that encourages genuine dialog rather than hard resistance.",
          "When utilizing this prompt in campaign platforms, make sure to pair the output with accurate prospect data merge tags (such as prospect name and company) to ensure maximum deliverability and authentic resonance."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      params: { slug: 'code-refactoring-optimization' },
      props: {
        title: "Clean Code Refactoring & Optimization Prompt",
        category: "Software Development",
        description: "Refactor legacy codebase snippets using modern TypeScript design patterns, performance optimization, and clean code principles.",
        image: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555066931-4365d14bab8c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80",
        promptText: "Assume the role of a principal software engineer. Review the attached code snippet, identify memory leaks and performance bottlenecks, apply clean code principles, and rewrite it using modern TypeScript best practices with detailed inline comments:",
        instructions: "Provide your source code directly below the prompt inside triple backticks (```).",
        articleTitle: "Accelerating Code Maintenance and Debt Reduction via AI",
        articleBody: [
          "Technical debt accumulates quickly in fast-paced software startups. Over time, unoptimized nested loops, redundant state transformations, and missing error handlers degrade application stability and developer velocity.",
          "Using AI for automated code review requires guiding the model toward specific architectural patterns. This refactoring prompt instructs the AI to evaluate algorithmic time complexity (Big-O notation) and modern typing standards rather than making simple cosmetic syntax edits.",
          "Always verify AI-generated refactored code with unit testing and integration suites in local staging environments prior to production deployment."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      params: { slug: 'photorealistic-midjourney-portrait' },
      props: {
        title: "Photorealistic Studio Portrait Midjourney Prompt",
        category: "Design & Midjourney",
        description: "Engineered prompt parameters for producing hyperrealistic 8K studio photography and portrait images with Midjourney v6.",
        image: "[https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80](https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80)",
        promptText: "A realistic portrait photo of a 30-year-old architect, cinematic lighting, 85mm lens, f/1.8, highly detailed skin texture, subtle background bokeh, professional studio lighting, hyperrealistic, 8k resolution --ar 16:9 --v 6.0",
        instructions: "Copy directly into Midjourney Discord (/imagine) or Midjourney Web alpha generator.",
        articleTitle: "Mastering Photographic Camera Parameters in Midjourney v6",
        articleBody: [
          "AI generative image models often produce plastic-looking skin or unnatural uncanny studio lighting when given simple natural language descriptions. Achieving true photographic realism requires specifying optical parameters such as focal length, aperture values, and specific lighting rigs.",
          "By specifying an '85mm lens' at 'f/1.8', this prompt instructs the rendering engine to simulate genuine depth of field and optical compression, creating professional portrait isolation from background elements.",
          "You can customize subject characteristics such as age, profession, attire, or color grade while maintaining the lens parameters to achieve consistent visual quality across an entire campaign."
        ]
      }
    }
  ];
}

const { title, category, description, image, promptText, instructions, articleTitle, articleBody } = Astro.props;
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{title} — PromptVibe HQ</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link href="[https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400;0,6..72,500;1,6..72,400&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap](https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400;0,6..72,500;1,6..72,400&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap)" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      body { background-color: #0e0e0e; color: #e0e0e0; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
      .font-serif-title { font-family: 'Newsreader', serif; }
      .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; width: 100%; }
      header { border-bottom: 1px solid #262626; background-color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 0.9); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 50; height: 80px; display: flex; align-items: center; }
      .header-content { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; width: 100%; }
      .logo { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
      .logo-dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; background-color: #22c55e; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }
      nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; }
      nav a { color: #a3a3a3; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; transition: color 0.2s; }
      nav a:hover { color: #fff; }

      .back-btn { color: #22c55e; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; font-family: monospace; display: inline-block; margin: 32px 0 16px 0; }
      .category-tag { font-size: 12px; font-family: monospace; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 9999px; background-color: #262626; color: #22c55e; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 16px; }
      h1 { font-size: 42px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.2; }
      .description { font-size: 18px; color: #a3a3a3; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 32px; }

      .adsense-slot { background-color: #141414; border: 1px dashed #333; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; color: #666; font-size: 12px; font-family: monospace; margin-bottom: 32px; }

      .preview-image { width: 100%; height: 400px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid #262626; margin-bottom: 32px; }

      .prompt-card { background-color: #171717; border: 1px solid #262626; border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
      .prompt-header { font-size: 12px; font-family: monospace; color: #22c55e; margin-bottom: 12px; }
      .prompt-box { background-color: #080808; border: 1px solid #262626; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: #fff; font-family: monospace; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 20px; white-space: pre-wrap; }
      .copy-btn { width: 100%; padding: 14px; background-color: #22c55e; color: #000; border: none; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; }
      .copy-btn:hover { background-color: #16a34a; }

      .article-section { background-color: rgba(23, 23, 23, 0.4); border: 1px solid #262626; border-radius: 16px; padding: 36px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
      .article-section h2 { color: #fff; font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
      .article-section p { color: #b3b3b3; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 300; }
      .article-section p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

      .instructions-card { background-color: #121212; border: 1px solid #262626; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 32px; color: #a3a3a3; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; }
      .instructions-card strong { color: #fff; }

      footer { border-top: 1px solid #262626; margin-top: 80px; padding: 40px 0; text-align: center; color: #737373; font-size: 12px; font-family: monospace; }
      .footer-links { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
      .footer-links a { color: #a3a3a3; text-decoration: none; }
      .footer-links a:hover { color: #fff; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    
    <header>
      <div class="container header-content">
        <a href="/" class="logo font-serif-title">
          <span class="logo-dot"></span>
          PromptVibe<span style="font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; color: #a3a3a3;">HQ</span>
        </a>
        <nav>
          <a href="/prompts">All Prompts</a>
          <a href="/about">About</a>
          <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
          <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container" style="flex-grow: 1;">
      <a href="/prompts" class="back-btn">← Back to All Prompts</a>
      
      <div>
        <span class="category-tag">{category}</span>
        <h1 class="font-serif-title">{title}</h1>
        <p class="description">{description}</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Top AdSense Banner -->
      <div class="adsense-slot">
        [ Google AdSense Top Responsive Slot ]
      </div>

      <img src={image} alt={title} class="preview-image" />

      <!-- Copyable Prompt Card -->
      <div class="prompt-card">
        <div class="prompt-header">COPYABLE PROMPT COMMAND</div>
        <div class="prompt-box" id="pContent">{promptText}</div>
        <button 
          class="copy-btn"
          onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(document.getElementById('pContent').innerText); this.innerText='Copied to Clipboard! ✓'; setTimeout(()=>this.innerText='Copy Prompt 📋', 2000)"
        >
          Copy Prompt 📋
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="instructions-card">
        <strong>Usage Recommendation:</strong> {instructions}
      </div>

      <!-- Mid-Content AdSense Banner -->
      <div class="adsense-slot">
        [ Google AdSense In-Article Slot ]
      </div>

      <!-- Rich SEO Article Content for AdSense Approval -->
      <article class="article-section">
        <h2 class="font-serif-title">{articleTitle}</h2>
        {articleBody.map((paragraph) => (
          <p>{paragraph}</p>
        ))}
      </article>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/prompts">All Prompts</a>
        <a href="/about">About Us</a>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
      </div>
      <p>© 2026 PromptVibe HQ. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>